 The Daily Loaf Bakery Website

1. Project Overview

The Daily Loaf Bakery is a bakery website designed to provide customers
with information about the bakery, its products and services.

The website has been designed with a warm and welcoming bakery theme
using light beige, warm cream and cream colours.

2. Purpose of the Website

The purpose of the website is to:

- Introduce The Daily Loaf Bakery to customers.
- Display the bakery's products and menu.
- Provide information about the bakery.
- Allow customers to make enquiries.
- Provide contact information.
- Show the bakery location using a map.
- Create a professional online presence for the business.

 3. Website Pages

The website consists of the following pages:

 Home
The Home page introduces The Daily Loaf Bakery and contains a
welcome section, bakery image, navigation buttons and information
about the bakery.

About
The About page provides information about The Daily Loaf Bakery,
its background, values and services.
Menu
The Menu page displays the bakery products and their prices.
Customers can select products and add them to the cart.

Enquiry
The Enquiry page allows customers to submit an enquiry about
products, custom cakes or special orders.

Contact
The Contact page provides the bakery's contact details, opening
hours and location map.

4. Technologies Used

The website was developed using:

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Google Maps
- Web browser

HTML was used to create the structure and content of the website.
CSS was used to style the pages, colours, layout, buttons, images
and navigation.

5. Website Design

The website uses a bakery-inspired colour scheme consisting of:

- Light Beige
- Warm Cream
- Cream
- Soft Golden Brown

The colours were selected to create a warm and welcoming appearance
that suits a bakery business.

6. Images

Images are used throughout the website to make the pages more
visually appealing.

The main bakery logo is stored in the images folder:

    images/Bakery Logo.jpg.jpg

The main bakery image is stored in:

    images/bakery.jpg

7. Navigation

The main navigation menu contains five pages:

- Home
- About
- Menu
- Enquiry
- Contact

Each page is connected using HTML hyperlinks.

8. Contact Map

The Contact page contains an embedded map to help visitors identify
the bakery's location.

The map is displayed using an iframe.
9. Website Folder Structure

The project is organised as follows:

    The-Daily-Loaf-Bakery/
    |
    |-- index.html
    |-- about.html
    |-- menu.html
    |-- enquiry.html
    |-- contact.html
    |-- style.css
    |
    |-- images/
    |   |-- Bakery Logo.jpg.jpg
    |   |-- bakery.jpg
    |
    |-- README.md

 10. Conclusion

The Daily Loaf Bakery website provides customers with an easy way
to learn about the bakery, view its menu, make enquiries and find
contact information.

The website uses a simple, professional and user-friendly design
with consistent colours and navigation across the pages.

